# Kovax docs first

For this repo, prefer **docs over full codebase search**.

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (root).
2. Then only the relevant file under `docs/`:
   - `docs/architecture.md` — boot, layers, deploy
   - `docs/server.md` — Nest, WebSocket, sectors, quests
   - `docs/frontend.md` — Next, Zustand, Phaser
   - `docs/database.md` — models, migrations
   - `docs/conventions.md` — gotchas

Open source files only after you know which path to change. Use Yarn, not npm.

When you change code: update matching `docs/` files and add bullets under `CHANGELOG.md` → `[Unreleased]`. On a versioned release: bump `package.json` and move notes into a dated `CHANGELOG` section (see `docs/conventions.md`).
